  "Bow-tie__UWB_3-10_GHz"
  (at 100 100)
  (version 20221018)
  (generator pcb_antenna_designer)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Two triangular arms fed at their tips: a balanced, wideband dipole. The arm length LA sets the lowest frequency, the flare angle A widens the band and lowers the impedance. The feed is set to 100 ohm, as seen through a 1:2 balun. It keeps about two-thirds of the UWB band (3.1-10.6 GHz) below -10 dB and stays near -7 dB elsewhere; for the whole band, see the UWB disc monopole.")
